              "text": "A mining-region landslide (Ashfell Slide) occurred near Dreth, damaging the lower road and prompting evacuations from Withel terraces and Cranmoor. Warnings were issued for the Withel terraces and Cranmoor areas. Approximately 60 households were evacuated from Withel terraces as part of the response.",
